{"id":1179,"level":68,"name":"Подвійний напад конем","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p>Knights are great at double attacks! A double attack by a knight is called a knight fork. Knight forks are very common. Since knights do not move in a straight direction, a knight&rsquo;s fork-trick often comes as a surprise. But if you practice a lot, you&rsquo;ll get better at spotting them in advance.</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Use a knight to attack two pieces at the time and win material.</p>  <p>Ask yourself these two questions:</p>  <ul>  <li>Are there any loose pieces?</li>  <li>How can I attack them at the same time?</li>  </ul>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"r1b1k2r/ppp2ppp/5n2/1N2p3/4P3/8/PP3PPP/3RK2R w Kkq - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ra8,Re8][%cal Gb5c7]} 1. Nxc7+ Ke7 2. Nxa8 1-0","text":"<p>кінь стрибає вперед і розбиває короля та туру. Шкода величезна.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":49402,"fen":"8/6n1/6k1/3pP2p/p2P3K/P7/3B4/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd4,Yh4]} 1... Nf5+ {[%csl Rd4,Rh4]} 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40605,"fen":"8/8/3k4/2r5/2P1p2p/4P2P/3N1K2/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc5,Yd6]} 1. Nxe4+ Kc6 2. Nxc5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40653,"fen":"8/p7/1pk5/5p2/2n3p1/6P1/P5K1/3R4 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd1,Yg2]} 1... Ne3+ 2. Kf2 Nxd1+ 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50836,"fen":"3b4/3N1k2/1PB1p2p/2K3p1/6r1/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yf7,Yg4]} 1. Ne5+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48439,"fen":"2kr3r/ppqnbpp1/4pn1p/4N2P/3p4/6N1/PPPBQPP1/1K1RR3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd8,Yh8]} 1. Nxf7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48994,"fen":"b5k1/4pp1p/6p1/8/B2nP3/5P1P/6P1/2B3K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc1,Yg1]} 1... Ne2+ 2. Kf2 Nxc1 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThem